Hi,
You should be able to use ENCODE data (if you are working on human and using RRBS), otherwise you have to search GEO or publications to find a control sample that matches your experimental constraints.

see here for how to use ENCODE RRBS data in methylKit:
http://zvfak.blogspot.ch/2013/03/using-encode-methylation-data-rrbs-in-r.html

Best,
Altuna

