The sample is RRBS and it is from mouse so you can use it as control but I don't know if it makes sense to compare your sample against this particular sample.

That's something you need to discuss with whoever designed your experiment, they would know better which samples would be a good control for your particular experiment when doing differential methylation analysis.

Best,
Altuna

