Hi,
Thank you so much for taking the time to look this over. However, as I was getting ready to e-mail you the data sets, I looked over them once more and discovered the problem. For some reason, I am getting multiple lines for the same site, all with different methylation values listed for same genomic position. There appears to be a problem with how our program is extracting position information of the negative strand. This certainly explains why unite() is having problems.
Jason

