do getwd() to see your working directory. It's very probable that your working directory is not  your desktop. you have to either set your working directory to your desktop or give full path to the files,
 in unix systems, it is similar to this:

 file.list = list( "/home/user/desktop/text.txt",  "/home/user/desktop/control.txt")

this is just an example you will need to change it for your own system and windows paths are slightly different (use google to search for examples).

In addition, it says in the comments section of the code I sent : "for your own analysis you will just need to provide set of paths to files".

That means you need to provide paths to files, just as I explained above. Please read the comments carefully.

Best,
Altuna

