But you are not following the example I sent or in the documentation:
examples have "location" argument which is a list of files and "sample.id <http://sample.id>" which is a list of ids if the "location" is a list. Your code doesn't have the "sample.id <http://sample.id>" argument.

if the examples are working and your own code is not, I suggest checking what is different between your own code and the examples, in this case you are missing an argument.

I think that might resolve this issue?

Best,
Altuna

